-> Test: native module emission — FireException handler emits an Exception particle.
link native_modules/libtest_helper.so as helper

-> Define local handler for emitted Exception particles.
Exception { source ∈ String, message ∈ String } => {
    assert source = "test_helper"
    assert message = "something went wrong"
    return Exception { source = source, message = message }
}

-> Invoking FireException handler emits an Exception particle.
req = helper.FireException { message = "something went wrong" }
emit req to helper get _
